/*
 * $DOC$
 * $NAME$
 * wgPanel
 *
 * $ONELINER$
 * Container for the controls on a sidebar page
 *
 * $SYNTAX$
 * oSidebar:Panel( nPage ) --> oPanel
 *
 * $ARGUMENTS$
 * `nPage` One-based page number returned by `oSidebar:Add()`.
 *
 * $RETURNS$
 * The `wgPanel` for the page.
 *
 * $DESCRIPTION$
 * Pass the panel to constructors of controls that belong to the page. The panel stacks them vertically. The sidebar shows the panel when its page is selected.
 *
 * $CATEGORY$
 * User libraries WebGUI
 *
 * $SEEALSO$
 * wgSidebar, wgBox, wgColumn
 *
 * $DOCEND$
 */
